<section id="launcher" aria-label="Presentation start"><div class="launchCard"><div class="launchTag">DATRC 2026 · IMMERSIVE DOCUMENTARY</div><h2>A story of families.<br><span style="color:#a8ead6">A community of hope.</span></h2><p>17 speech-synced scenes · 28 unique documentary photographs · cinematic motion when connected, reliable CSS motion offline. The projection stays clean with hidden controls.</p><div class="launchActions"><button class="primary" id="btnStart">▶ Start Fullscreen</button><button id="btnWindowed">Preview Windowed</button><button id="btnCustomize">⚙ Director Settings</button></div><p class="microEngine" id="engineTag">Loading optional online animation engine…</p><p style="font-size:12px;opacity:.7;margin:18px 0 0" id="launchHint">Arrow keys change scenes · Hover top-right for hidden controls · Press U to show controls, H to hide them completely.</p></div></section>
